OL,3,GNEWSAPolice say no weapons used in
OL,4,Ajewellery store raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetectives investigating a robbery that
OL,7,Fleft a jewellery store employee
OL,8,Ffighting for his life have confirmed no
OL,9,Fweapons were used in the attack.
OL,11,FSix men raided Lala Jewellers on
OL,12,FGladstone Street in Peterborough
OL,13,Fshortly before midday on Saturday,
OL,14,FCambridgeshire Police said.
OL,16,FOn Monday, officers confirmed the
OL,17,Fincident was not a stabbing and that
OL,18,F"no weapons were used" during the
OL,19,Fattack. Detectives said the
OL,20,Finvestigation was at an early stage and
OL,21,Fappealed for witnesses to come forward.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
